Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:04.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第4季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.87,0:00:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个好梦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你是我最喜爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, you're my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我体内流着魔鬼的血？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean I have demon blood in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我们的一生都用来搜寻这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, our whole lives have been searching for this demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西杀死了杰西 杀死了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}that thing killed jess!that thing killed mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are you?castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是那个紧紧抓住你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm the one who gripped you tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你出地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and raised you from perdition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我意思是 你是什么 - 我是伺奉主的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean, what are you?i'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨缪尔 库尔特打造了一把特别的枪.这把枪能杀死任何的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- samuel colt made a special gun.this gun can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么一个天使要救我出地狱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would an angel rescue me from hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是主的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}because god commanded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们有任务交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we have work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你梦到了些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what were you dreaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有窥视别人睡觉的怪癖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you get your freak on by watching other people sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}move it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能睡在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't sleep here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.73,0:02:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}sleep where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里都行就是不能在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}anywhere but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我这是在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, where the hell am i?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰伊小鸟餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}jay bird's diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢 不过我意思是 哪座城市 哪个州\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, thanks.i mean, uh, city and state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯 堪萨斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}lawrence, kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you okay, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}tough night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 瑞奇 来一杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, uh, coffee here, reg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我哪里可以接收到手机信号呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you tell me where I can get reception on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家军工厂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the u.s.s. enterprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:03:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}nice threads.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道桑尼和雪儿分手了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know sonny and cher broke up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑尼和雪儿分手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}sonny and cher broke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 温切斯特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- hey, winchester!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这家伙！你在这儿干嘛 下士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- son of a bitch! how you doin', corporal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 D先生 - 我听说你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- hey, mr. d. - I heard you were back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 刚回来不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}- yeah, a little while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了就好 约翰-真他妈的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}good to have you home, john - - damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 代我向你老爸为好 - 好的 D先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- say hello to your old man for me.-you got it, mr. d.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认识吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do we know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松点 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}take it easy, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这像是要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一切是真的 - 千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- is it real? - very.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,是吗 天使也生产时空飞车（来自电影《回到未来》）？\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay, so, what, angels got their hands on some deloreans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么到这儿的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,时空是可以变换的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}time is fluid, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这并不容易 但我们偶尔是可以曲扭时空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not easy, but we can bend it on occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 把它扭回去 要不就告诉这我该死的在这儿究竟做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, bend it back. or tell me what the hell i'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止什么？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop what? huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟是什么 是我老爸有危险吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what, is there something nasty after my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能好好回答问题吗 你这个混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}what, are you allergic to straight answers, you son of a bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 年轻人看你是第一次买车\N{\fnArial\fs30}fine young man like yourself just starting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再给你优惠250美元如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how about I take off another $250?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去处理手续\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll get the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not the one you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟踪我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我只是刚好路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, no.i was just passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没感谢你今天早上请我喝的那杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}i never got to thank you for that cup of coffee this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时有点冒犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i was a little out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}more than a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我弥补一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me repay the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是你想要的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the car you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你对车很有研究吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, yeah? you know something about cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我父亲教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, my dad taught me everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是辆好车\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this… this is a great car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,327四腔 275匹马力\N{\fnArial\fs30}327 four-barrel, 275 horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,破是破了点 但绝对是个宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little tlc, this thing is cherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, man…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买刚刚那个干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you buying that thing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应别人要买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of promised someone I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,连67年的雪佛兰也比不上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}over a '67 chevy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 这是千载难逢的好车\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean, come on.this is the car of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 那辆车就是在40年代也很不济\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust me, this thing's still gonna be badass when it's 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫约翰 温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}john winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩 范 海伦（电影里的驱魔人）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean van halen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我有些莽撞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}i was in pretty rough shape this morning, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}no kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也试过宿醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}i've been hung over before, but, hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那快餐店实在令人心寒\N{\fnArial\fs30}i was getting chills in that diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得发寒吧 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't feel any of those cold spots, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定 我闻到了奇怪的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}i swore I smelled something weird, too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,像臭鸡蛋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}like rotten eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会碰巧闻到硫磺的味道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't happen to smell any sulfur, by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小镇有牲口离奇死亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have there been any cattle mutilations in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 老兄 别问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay, mister, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能找到对策的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if only I knew what to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说…你自己要万事小心 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen, uh…watch out for yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah. sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买这辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新车\N{\fnArial\fs30}my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆有蓬货车怎么不好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened to the van?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.23,0:09:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 这比那辆货车好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary, this is better than the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有327四腔汽化器\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's got a 327, a 4-barrel carburetor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 无论你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}sammy, wherever you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住妈妈是个美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}mom is a babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}i should just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸就那样 约翰 他和你不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dad's being my dad, john.it's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么和我不同 他这样都几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how is it not me?he's been like this for how many years?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是太过爱护我罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's just protective over me, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's doesn't want me to…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,和机械工家和技工儿子交往吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}hook up with a mechanic from a family of mechanics?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:10:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢你现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}i love you for exactly what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么老跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are you following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从我家跟踪我们到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been trailing us since my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你瞎扯什么 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't know what you're talking about.oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在我们可以谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay, how about we talk about this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是猎手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点见\N{\fnArial\fs30}see you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你有没有运气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道要不要让你进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm not sure you should come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们都是本行 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean, come on, we're all hunters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 俺们还是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}i mean, we're - - we're practically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 我爸 他有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thing is, my dad, he's a little, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更要会会他\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, i got to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've heard of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,百闻不如一见\N{\fnArial\fs30}clearly, not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说 你是猎手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, you're a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我猎手先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, tell me something, Mr. Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是用木桩还是银匕首杀死吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you kill vampires with wooden stakes or silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是 直接把头剁下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}neither.you cut their heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通过你的考验了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, do I pass your test?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以走人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now get out of my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信别的猎手 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't trust other hunters, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需他们的支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't want their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要他们介入我的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't want them around my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 萨缪尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}knock it off, samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个猎手\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也通过了你的快问快答测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}who passed your little pop quiz,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.13,0:12:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算留他下来共进晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now i'm inviting him to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你饿吗 - 快饿晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hungry?starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫萨缪尔 你也知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've met my husband, samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在快去洗手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}now wash up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨缪尔和…迪安娜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}samuel and…Deanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次来劳伦斯吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}first time in lawrence, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}well…been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必这里也人事几番新了\N{\fnArial\fs30}things sure have changed…i think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有任务在身吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you working a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可能有\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, ybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是 我也不轻易相信别的猎手 萨缪尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means I don't trust other hunters either, samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要跟踪我和约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, why were you following me and john?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为有些鬼魂盯上了你…男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}i thought something was after your - - your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, um, i don't think that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 温彻斯特被鬼魂缠上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}john winchester mixing it up with spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以想象吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个酸巴巴的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sour-lemon look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰真的是和很好的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}john's a really, really nice…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,淳朴良民\N{\fnArial\fs30}…naive civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,又如何 你宁愿我和这样的人一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, what, would you rather me be with a guy like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}what? no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 我不是那个意思 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary, of course not.it's just that I - -
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个说够了 我们还有客人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's enough, both of you.we have company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你呢 萨穆 也有任务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, what about you, sam?you, uh, working a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在韦特夏尔农场工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's working a job on the whitshire farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦特夏尔 这听起来怎么这么像我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}whitshire - - why does that name sound familiaro me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这白色黑字上有 汤姆 韦特夏尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been all over the papers tom whitshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些附近的镇子都联合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}got tangled up in a combine a few towns over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这类事情常发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that kind of thing happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了为什么他准备在第一现场动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}except why was he on it in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他的农作物都枯萎的时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when his crops arare all dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔的预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}demonic omens?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我设法想查出来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what I got to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上其他地方呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what about the rest of the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在网上有查到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you find anything on the web?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些…信息 你搜集到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of…information that you have assembled?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是电能风暴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}electrical storms, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,气象图应该在星期五就能拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}the weather service graphs should be here on friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,用邮递\N{\fnArial\fs30}by mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.76,0:14:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 昨晚我们租了一架飞机 让他们载过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, we hired a jetliner to fly them to us overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 这听起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, it sounds to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像是在猎同一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}like we might be hunting the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 如果我们能多点人一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, if we go in there in numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,相互间就能得到很好的照应\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll take care of this real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道什么叫「我们各自为战」么 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}what part of "we work alone"do you not understand, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以在这里是因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i'm here because…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族事业 玛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}family business, mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你宁愿在一群大学运动员当中当啦啦队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what, you'd rather be waving pom-poms at a bunch of dumb jocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去干活了 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do the job, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里真让我吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}i see you beat me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,主也挺幽默的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lord is funny that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 韦特夏尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}beth whitshire…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.43,0:15:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is my associate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们年长的牧师 切尼神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}our senior senior priest, father cheney.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表教区\N{\fnArial\fs30}please accept our deepest condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,致以我们最衷心的哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}on behalf of the county diocese.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦特夏尔夫人刚告诉了我关于汤姆的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}miss whitshire was just telling me all about tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还提起了他死前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how normal and ordinary things were.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所发生的一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the day before his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}i see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你真的没注意到有特别的地方吗 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you didn't notice anything unusual, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是我丈夫的精力突然恢复到40岁的样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you mean like my husband's guts fertilizing the back 40?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 你能告诉神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}charlie, would you like to tell the father here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚你对我说的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you just told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸有时候喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad drank sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 他对妈妈很粗暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes he got rough with mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那时 一个陌生人进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's when the stranger came?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他只是个传教士\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just thought he was some bible-thumper,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在一个星期前曾出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}he showed up about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}saying what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我想不想阻止这些暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}did I want the beatings to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我只认为他是个疯子 我没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just thought he was crazy.i didn't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 爸爸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next thing I know, dad's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去蹲监狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}am I going to jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't do this, charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个陌生人有没有索要什么作为回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}did the stranger want something in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么都不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}he didn't want anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 查克 他不会白施舍人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on, chuck.he wasn't just handing out freebies, now, was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确实说了什么未来的召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}he did say something about coming a-calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起10年内\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能会有想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe he'd want something then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我告诉你了 他是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, i told you he was nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他刚把灵魂出卖给了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}i think he just pimped his soul to a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:16:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对此一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he doesn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 你记得那陌生人长什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}charlie, do you remember what the stranger looked like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.23,0:17:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大概5尺10寸 白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's about 5'10"… white.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是那种看上去很正常的人 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was kind of normal-looking, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确有一样很特别 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was one thing.what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他的眼 他的眼球很怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just, the light hit his eyes in a weird way, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一阵子 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a moment, i could have sworn - -
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是黄色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗黄色\N{\fnArial\fs30}pale yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.03,0:17:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们慢慢来 把事情整理一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you say we just slow down and talk this thing through?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么可说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你说有个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}except you're saying there's a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们都没听说过黄眼睛的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and none of us has ever heard of demon with yellow eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, well, i have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西杀了我全家\N{\fnArial\fs30}this thing killed my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静 - 你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- just calm down, son. - you don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在很危险 我们都处于危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are in danger. we are all in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该为自己找个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in fact, you need to get yourself someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得先让我知道我们对付的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}not until we know what we're dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆是对的 迪恩 它可能是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam's right, Dean. it could be a demon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是无形人 或是其它什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could be a shapeshifter, any number of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}i know what this thing is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i'm gonna kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all the talking I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀一个恶魔 怎么杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna kill a demon? how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个叫丹尼尔·艾金斯的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a hunter named daniel elkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他住在科罗拉多 他有把库尔特手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives in colorado. He has coIt's gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,库尔特手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是听说过库尔特手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, i heard about the colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.63,0:18:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾把它当作睡前故事讲给玛丽听\N{\fnArial\fs30}i used to tell it to mary as a bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就算是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right, say that it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道有颗水晶球\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got some kind of a crystal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉你恶魔会出现在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}telling you where this demon's gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我就是有\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, maybe I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 一份笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what's this? - it's a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么的笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.90,0:18:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲写下了所有与黄眼睛恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dad wrote down anyone he thought ever came in contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触时的信息 包括时间 地点 人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the yellow-eyed demon. who, where, and when.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他对那恶魔有越多的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the more he could learn about the son of a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就越有可能弄清楚为什么它杀死我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more he could figure out why it killed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦特夏尔农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}whitshire farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过这名字听着耳熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}i told you that name sounded familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦特夏尔农场 那可是两天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}whitshire farms - - that was two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么会在你父亲的笔记上\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the hell is that on your dad's list?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲能预见未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dad could see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这儿 说它明晚会袭击那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}look at this - - says he's gonna hit here tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽迪·沃尔什\N{\fnArial\fs30}liddy walsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海利镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}haleyville.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有3英里 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, it's about 3 miles, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们认为我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i know you guys think i'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着是个不错的小伙 但是你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you seem like a really nice kid, Dean, but, yeah, you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道这混蛋要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know where this bastard's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i'm gonna stop it…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了它一劳永逸\N{\fnArial\fs30}once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i, uh, i'm shoving off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来说声再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just wanted to say "bye."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:19:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, i have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, i wanted to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, for what it's worth, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的想法并不那么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't matter what your dad thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}i like that john kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你们俩注定是一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, i think you two are meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就指望你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}hell, i'm depending on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what? - nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问你个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰他是怎样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's he like - - john?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是好奇心而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's sweet…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在战后 在一切都过去之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}even after the war, after everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他仍然相信「幸福终局」这样的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}he still believes in "happily ever after, " you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有着猎人所没有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's everything a hunter isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有冒犯你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.93,0:21:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, none taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟你说件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can I tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他快要向我求婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna ask me to marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想就在明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}tomorrow, i think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸肯定会气爆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, dad's gonna explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有必要的话我就私奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll run away if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}i love john.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}i want to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的工作 这样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}this job, this life…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}i hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}i want a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要有安全感\N{\fnArial\fs30}i want to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能想像到的最糟糕的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, the worst thing I can think of…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最最糟糕的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very worst thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我的孩子像我一样长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}is for my children to be raised into this, like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, i won't let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah. no, i'm - - i'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跟你说件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can I tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.40,0:22:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使这听起来很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if this sounds really weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能答应我把它记住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you promise me that you will remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.90,0:22:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.40,0:22:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到1983年11月2日那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}on november 2, 1983…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't get out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.33,0:22:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你听见或看见什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what you hear or what you see…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.93,0:23:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我千万别下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}…promise me you won't get out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.16,0:23:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝是我的副驾驶 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, what, god's my co-pilot? is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个普通爱说闲话的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, you're a regular chatty cathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.43,0:23:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆很想知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam would have wanted in on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不把他带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not bring him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.33,0:23:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得自己完成 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you had to do this alone, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.16,0:24:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不必担心他正在揭开的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't care that he's tearing up the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.73,0:24:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆没有找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam's not looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.26,0:24:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果我这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right, \Nif I do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个家庭的诅咒就被解除了对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the family curse breaks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.83,0:24:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈就幸福的生活下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mom and dad live happily ever after,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.43,0:24:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和我快乐成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sam and I grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.83,0:24:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩着老鹰捉小鸡游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing little league and chasing tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.23,0:24:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要意识到如果你这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you realize if you do alter the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.13,0:24:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲 你 萨姆 你们永远不会变成猎手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father, you, sam, you'll never become hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有你救过的人都会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all those people you saved, they'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}i realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.63,0:24:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在乎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't care?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.00,0:24:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, i care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.76,0:24:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}i care a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.30,0:24:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们是我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these are my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.93,0:24:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他们再次死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm not gonna let them die again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.83,0:24:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}i can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.73,0:24:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 如果我能阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}not if I can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 站那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold it right there, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.41,0:25:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.15,0:25:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙你自己的事去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}be on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.41,0:25:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这么做 丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't do it, daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.08,0:25:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.11,0:25:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也和你们一样是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hunter, just like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.98,0:25:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说小偷更合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}"thief" is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.31,0:25:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是借用几天而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just need itfor a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.31,0:25:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再发生了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}not happening, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.41,0:25:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 我现在有机会拯救我的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, i have a chance to save my family's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.01,0:25:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要这把枪帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need this gun to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.55,0:25:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要阻止我那你杀了我得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you want to stop me, kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.75,0:26:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在劳伦斯还有些猎手 坎贝尔一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's some hunters in lawrence the campbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.45,0:26:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}never heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.51,0:26:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会在那里出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's where she'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.65,0:26:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩说他会去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean say where he was going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他去杀恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said he was gonna kill a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.88,0:26:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.61,0:26:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.95,0:26:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.11,0:26:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}where?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.41,0:26:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚哎 在海利镇那边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, i don't know over in haleyville.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在沃尔什\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, walshes, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.98,0:26:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 不是丽迪·沃尔什\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, wait - - not liddy walsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.95,0:26:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 我估计是\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, yeah, i-i think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.98,0:26:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 她是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad, she's a friend of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.01,0:26:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.41,0:26:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.41,0:26:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在车里等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll be in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.81,0:26:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.45,0:26:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想去捕猎 她不想去捕猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wants to hunt, she doesn't want to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.08,0:26:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一些女人每月必修之事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this some female "time of month" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.58,0:27:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 丽迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm sorry, liddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.95,0:27:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移了已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's metastasized.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.18,0:27:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的肺 他的肝\N{\fnArial\fs30}his liver, his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.65,0:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该谈谈条件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's time we talked about arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.55,0:27:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊 你应该做点什么 布朗医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, you have to do something, dr. brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.21,0:27:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有个办法可以治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is one way a cure, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.75,0:27:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}but i'll need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.38,0:27:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.58,0:27:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.81,0:27:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但未来10年内我会去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in 10 years, i'm going to come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.71,0:27:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你要点东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ask for something then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.75,0:27:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.25,0:27:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会错过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing you'll miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.51,0:27:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.65,0:27:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.48,0:27:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.28,0:28:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你藏哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the hell have they been hiding you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}i like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got a lot of spunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.81,0:28:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}you let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.18,0:28:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪拿到枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}where'd you get that gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 他还对你说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary, what else did he say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.55,0:28:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过 他喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}i told you just that he liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.11,0:28:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话什么意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.48,0:28:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽迪是一个坚强的孩子 她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}liddy's a strong kid.she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.55,0:28:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.65,0:28:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般吧 我不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, dad, i'm pretty far from okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.51,0:28:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}can we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}nice job in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.85,0:29:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}i missed the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.91,0:29:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的不错 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}take the compliment, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.15,0:29:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了那都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm saying that I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.41,0:29:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要单独沟通下\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to talk alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.75,0:29:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去大开杀戒了不然玛丽就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to kill this thing now, or mary dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what? how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.81,0:29:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,少废话赶紧做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.15,0:29:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天吧可能 或许几年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, maybe today, probably years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.61,0:29:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一定会发生的 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's happening trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.05,0:29:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是不是变成什么先知了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, what, are you some kind of a psychic now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.81,0:29:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.75,0:29:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 这个听起来有一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, this is gonna sound a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.05,0:29:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 听起来挺变态的\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually, it's gonna sound massively, massively crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.35,0:29:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.95,0:29:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽是我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary is my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.41,0:29:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.21,0:29:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你孙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am your grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.68,0:29:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我他妈在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know what the hell i'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又想耍我是吗 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to run that by me again, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.68,0:29:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的真名是迪恩 温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}my real name is Dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生于1979年1月24日\N{\fnArial\fs30}i was born january 24, 1979.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.61,0:30:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母是玛丽和约翰 温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}my parents are mary and john winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.55,0:30:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不听你扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't have to listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.71,0:30:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽1983年被黄眼恶魔杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary gets killed by a yellow-eyed demon in 1983.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.01,0:30:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是 今晚会发什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, i think that this, what happened tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.58,0:30:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是他得到她线索的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}i think this is the moment that he caught her scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.61,0:30:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如果不抓紧把它干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, if we don't catch this thing now and kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.58,0:30:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it gets away…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.48,0:30:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then mary dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.45,0:30:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我在问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so i'm asking you…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.75,0:30:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.08,0:30:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}y-you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.08,0:30:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应会带我离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}you promised you'd take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.31,0:30:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.61,0:30:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就赶紧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.05,0:30:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道库尔特手枪的事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did I know about the colt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.48,0:30:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道黄眼恶魔的事情啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did I know about the yellow-eyed demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.38,0:30:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者还能是哪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}or where it would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.58,0:30:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会等这一切发生的 萨缪尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm not making this up, samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.51,0:31:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身体里的每一块血肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}every bone in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.81,0:31:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都准备把你打到6尺远的地方 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}is aching to put you six feet under, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.11,0:31:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你的事情 我不能改变它\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something about you I can't shake it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.91,0:31:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在比你更抓狂了孩子 但我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, i may be crazier than you, son, but I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.51,0:31:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.98,0:31:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么找到那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do we find this bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.85,0:31:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里 笔记上\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here - - the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.01,0:31:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,用库尔特手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with the colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.95,0:31:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.98,0:31:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不让别人碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorry.i don't let anybody hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.58,0:31:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.01,0:31:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.75,0:31:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你现在准备要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially when it's me you're trying to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}i only know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.43,0:32:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够改变这一切的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's got the juice to swing something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.63,0:32:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上头一定有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must have friends in high places.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.86,0:32:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我杀了你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, i kill your mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.76,0:32:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为啥你来看小时候的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's why you came all this way to see little ol' me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.83,0:32:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里为了干掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, i came here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.70,0:32:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.40,0:32:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个愣头青娶了你妈 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that slug marries your mommy, are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.86,0:32:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的一个有超能力的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you one of my psychic kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.13,0:32:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.26,0:32:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你有个妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you got a sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.53,0:33:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.73,0:33:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.56,0:33:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可都解决啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}that means it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.16,0:33:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 这是我为什么来这儿的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all, it's why i'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.20,0:33:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你要做的交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that's what this is about these deals you're making.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.23,0:33:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想要这些人的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't want these people's souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.16,0:33:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.23,0:33:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要他们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just want their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.90,0:33:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里选择这些完美的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm here to choose the perfect parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.30,0:33:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你妈妈一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.76,0:33:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么选她\N{\fnArial\fs30}why her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.30,0:33:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么选择他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}why any of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.73,0:33:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们纯洁而坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they're strong.they're pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.30,0:33:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们吃自己的粮食\N{\fnArial\fs30}they eat their wheaties.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.23,0:33:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己的小怪物比赛 他们是理想的牲畜\N{\fnArial\fs30}my own little master race.they're ideal breeders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.90,0:33:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想得这么龌龊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, get your mind out of the gutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.00,0:33:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人和我一起教养\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one's breeding with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.50,0:33:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}though mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.63,0:33:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 我想做个例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}man, i'd like to make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.86,0:33:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止 她是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}so far, she's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.66,0:33:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么做这些交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, why make the deals?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}i need permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.56,0:33:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要邀请才能进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}i need to be invited into their houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.03,0:33:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 你们这些白痴靠官文指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}i know, i know the red tape will drive you nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.76,0:34:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在短短的10年里 它将证明它的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in 10 short years, it'll all be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你知道我要对你的兄弟姐妹做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause you know what i'm gonna do to your sibling?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.96,0:34:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会从后面勒住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm gonna stand over their crib,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让血从他们嘴里流出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and i'm gonna bleed into their mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.30,0:34:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔的血可比什么维他命矿物质强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}demon blood is better than ovaltine, vitamins, minerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.33,0:34:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你变成肌肉壮汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes you big and strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.03,0:34:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们就可以领导乌合之众的恶魔军了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can lead your discount demon army?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的宏伟计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that your big plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.73,0:34:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.80,0:34:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的终结规划比这个要庞大多了小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}my endgame's a hell of a lot bigger than that, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.30,0:34:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,终结规划 什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}endgame? what endgame?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.96,0:34:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like i'm gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.06,0:34:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者那些坐在你肩膀上的天使会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or those angels sitting on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.86,0:34:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.03,0:34:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好好掩护我的行踪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm gonna cover my tracks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.30,0:34:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈想掩藏什么就掩藏什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can cover whatever the hell you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.50,0:34:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'm still gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.50,0:34:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.23,0:34:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, that, i'd like to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.06,0:34:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是今天也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.33,0:34:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛 你个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you look into my eyes, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.06,0:34:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那个结束你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause i'm the one that kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.43,0:35:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备拯救每个人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, you're gonna save everybody.is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.23,0:35:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.06,0:35:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 有个人你不会救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, i'll tell you one person that you're not gonna save.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}your grandpappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:35:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.56,0:35:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这不是个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, I guess it's no secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.33,0:36:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我带你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I brought you way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.40,0:36:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}john.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.96,0:36:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}just…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.03,0:36:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我进去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just let me get through this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.93,0:36:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.43,0:36:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 你还不够了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's things you don't know about me, john.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.73,0:36:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}so?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.10,0:36:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁我都会永远爱着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i will always love you for exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.03,0:36:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说什么了老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did I tell you? dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.13,0:36:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}sir, just listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.10,0:36:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}ow! dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.76,0:36:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.40,0:36:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.80,0:36:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey, take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.53,0:36:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.30,0:36:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.16,0:36:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是约翰 小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, not just john, sweetie pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.13,0:37:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}mommy and daddy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.73,0:37:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.03,0:37:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.16,0:37:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}yep. 'fraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.83,0:37:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在成了小孤儿玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're little orphan mary now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.36,0:37:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.63,0:37:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 棍子和石头会击碎我的骨头的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, sticks and stones may break my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们也不会把你家庭带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they won't bring your family back either.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.70,0:37:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.30,0:37:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向上帝发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}i swear to god.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.00,0:37:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们不要这么肉麻好不\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, let's not get nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.53,0:37:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我们都说了些后悔的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, look, we both said some things that we regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.26,0:37:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.06,0:37:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻别吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}kiss and make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.36,0:37:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.03,0:37:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让我的孩子恢复呼吸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll arrange to have lover boy here brought back breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.06,0:37:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父母也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}my parents, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.53,0:37:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.56,0:37:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉小妞 这可不在计划中\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorry, doll.that's not on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.83,0:37:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.83,0:37:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以永远远离猎人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could be done with hunting forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.40,0:38:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有白色的围栏的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the white picket fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.00,0:38:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,到全国去旅行 拥有几个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}station wagon, couple of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.10,0:38:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在有妖怪或是恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}no more monsters or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.26,0:38:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以保证这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.23,0:38:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？而这一切就是要用我的灵魂来交换？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?and all it costs is my soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.16,0:38:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 你可以留着你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, no.you can keep your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.73,0:38:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要一个承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just need permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.83,0:38:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么承诺？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.20,0:38:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 十年内 我需要在你的家里呆呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}mm, in 10 years, I need to swing by your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.56,0:38:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了某点事情 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a little something, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.36,0:38:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}for…what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.90,0:38:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.56,0:38:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的计划不被打断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as i'm not interrupted,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.80,0:38:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没人会受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.96,0:38:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}i promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.93,0:38:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你的余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can spend the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.96,0:38:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,将绝望而孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}desperate and alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.40,0:38:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.73,0:38:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个不错的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 成交吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}no!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.70,0:39:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.23,0:39:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}john.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是没能阻止那场交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}i couldn't stop any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是和恶魔交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she still made the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.53,0:40:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是在育儿房死了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}she still died in the nursery, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.26,0:40:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太勉强你自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't be too hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.66,0:40:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能阻止得了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}you couldn't have stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.40,0:40:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.90,0:41:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运是不可能改变的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}destiny can't be changed, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.26,0:41:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的挣扎最终还是导向了同样的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}all roads lead to the same destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.16,0:41:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要让我回到过去干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}then why'd you send me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.46,0:41:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你知道了我们做的所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}now you know everything we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.10,0:41:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的你究竟在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.13,0:41:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where's sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.60,0:41:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚亚撒色对你弟弟做了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know what azazel did to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.60,0:41:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我们不知道这么做的原因 - 也不知道他想要最终的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what we don't know is why - what his endgame is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.60,0:41:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他费精心思去掩盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}he went to great lengths to cover that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.90,0:41:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆究竟在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where's sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.06,0:41:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,425 霍特曼工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}425 waterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟正步向危险之途 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}your brother is headed down a dangerous road, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们去无法确定它的去向\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're not sure where it leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:41:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.13,0:41:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 我们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we will.
